1
00:02:40,440 --> 00:02:43,880
<font color="#ffffff">He was asking about</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">something shiny and valuable.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

2
00:02:43,960 --> 00:02:45,640
<font color="#ffffff">I don't know what he was talking about.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

3
00:02:45,720 --> 00:02:47,240
<font color="#ffffff">PREVIOUSLY</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

4
00:02:47,320 --> 00:02:48,600
<font color="#ffffff">Could it be…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

5
00:02:48,680 --> 00:02:50,200
<font color="#ffffff">-Luang Pho!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-What's wrong?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

6
00:02:50,280 --> 00:02:54,120
<font color="#ffffff">My head hurts!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

7
00:02:54,200 --> 00:02:57,400
<font color="#ffffff">You've regained your memory, Boonrod?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

8
00:02:57,480 --> 00:02:59,720
<font color="#ffffff">I said, do you have the diamond?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

9
00:03:00,520 --> 00:03:02,160
<font color="#ffffff">Don't worry.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

10
00:03:03,120 --> 00:03:06,520
<font color="#ffffff">I'm going to get you a map</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

11
00:03:06,600 --> 00:03:08,400
<font color="#ffffff">showing where the diamond was hidden.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

12
00:03:08,480 --> 00:03:10,600
<font color="#ffffff">-No one is here?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-That's right.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

13
00:03:11,200 --> 00:03:13,600
<font color="#ffffff">They said their goodbyes and left.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

14
00:03:15,720 --> 00:03:17,920
<font color="#ffffff">What you're doing</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

15
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:20,120
<font color="#ffffff">will put you in danger, right?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

16
00:03:20,200 --> 00:03:22,200
<font color="#ffffff">It's fine, Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

17
00:03:22,280 --> 00:03:23,720
<font color="#ffffff">I know what I'm doing.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

18
00:03:23,800 --> 00:03:25,680
<font color="#ffffff">As of today,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

19
00:03:26,360 --> 00:03:29,360
<font color="#ffffff">you're reinstated, Captain Chansuek.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

20
00:03:29,440 --> 00:03:33,360
<font color="#ffffff">What matters most is that</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">you don't hurt the monk if they resist.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

21
00:03:33,440 --> 00:03:36,160
<font color="#ffffff">We need information from him, understood?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

22
00:03:55,280 --> 00:03:57,000
<font color="#ffffff">Captain Chansuek? Lieutenant Ae?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

23
00:03:59,800 --> 00:04:01,560
<font color="#ffffff">What's going on?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

24
00:04:02,160 --> 00:04:05,080
<font color="#ffffff">We've received information</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">that you took Luang Pho Suea.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

25
00:04:06,080 --> 00:04:08,360
<font color="#ffffff">We would like to bring him in</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">for questioning<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

26
00:04:08,440 --> 00:04:10,720
<font color="#ffffff">regarding Ms. Yok's diamond theft case.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

27
00:04:13,520 --> 00:04:15,520
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho Suea is not here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

28
00:04:15,600 --> 00:04:17,200
<font color="#ffffff">Please leave.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

29
00:04:18,200 --> 00:04:19,600
<font color="#ffffff">Lieutenant Ae.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

30
00:04:20,600 --> 00:04:21,720
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

31
00:04:24,600 --> 00:04:25,720
<font color="#ffffff">Hey,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

32
00:04:26,360 --> 00:04:27,840
<font color="#ffffff">this is an insult to me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

33
00:04:27,920 --> 00:04:30,520
<font color="#ffffff">You don't have a warrant, do you?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

34
00:04:30,600 --> 00:04:31,800
<font color="#ffffff">How could you do this?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

35
00:04:32,840 --> 00:04:34,440
<font color="#ffffff">It's Deputy Papon's orders.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

36
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:38,640
<font color="#ffffff">Any more questions?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

37
00:05:12,480 --> 00:05:14,920
<font color="#ffffff">No one's inside, Captain.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

38
00:05:18,800 --> 00:05:21,240
<font color="#ffffff">What? What did you say?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

39
00:05:22,320 --> 00:05:23,520
<font color="#ffffff">Captain Chansuek</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

40
00:05:23,600 --> 00:05:26,000
<font color="#ffffff">is coming to arrest Luang Pho Suea here?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

41
00:05:29,840 --> 00:05:31,080
<font color="#ffffff">It's true, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

42
00:05:31,840 --> 00:05:33,400
<font color="#ffffff">How do you know that?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

43
00:05:34,360 --> 00:05:37,360
<font color="#ffffff">I overheard them talking.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

44
00:05:38,520 --> 00:05:39,840
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

45
00:05:40,840 --> 00:05:42,400
<font color="#ffffff">for telling me this.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

46
00:05:42,480 --> 00:05:43,400
<font color="#ffffff">No problem.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

47
00:05:50,240 --> 00:05:51,520
<font color="#ffffff">Ya.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

48
00:05:54,440 --> 00:05:56,600
<font color="#ffffff">We need to get Luang Pho Suea out of here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

49
00:06:08,080 --> 00:06:09,680
<font color="#ffffff">B just texted to confirm.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

50
00:06:11,080 --> 00:06:12,400
<font color="#ffffff">We must leave now, Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

51
00:06:24,280 --> 00:06:25,880
<font color="#ffffff">I told you,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

52
00:06:25,960 --> 00:06:28,080
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho Suea isn't here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

53
00:06:30,080 --> 00:06:31,320
<font color="#ffffff">You can leave now.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

54
00:06:31,400 --> 00:06:33,320
<font color="#ffffff">I'm on leave.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

55
00:06:33,400 --> 00:06:35,200
<font color="#ffffff">Don't bother me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

56
00:06:35,800 --> 00:06:37,240
<font color="#ffffff">I'm afraid I can't.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

57
00:06:39,200 --> 00:06:40,840
<font color="#ffffff">I was ordered</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

58
00:06:41,600 --> 00:06:44,240
<font color="#ffffff">to bring you in for questioning as well.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

59
00:07:02,280 --> 00:07:03,680
<font color="#ffffff">INVESTIGATION ROOM</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

60
00:07:13,960 --> 00:07:14,960
<font color="#ffffff">Lieutenant.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

61
00:07:15,560 --> 00:07:16,400
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, sir?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

62
00:07:16,480 --> 00:07:17,520
<font color="#ffffff">How's it going?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

63
00:07:17,600 --> 00:07:20,160
<font color="#ffffff">Captain Chansuek is interrogating him now.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

64
00:07:40,040 --> 00:07:41,400
<font color="#ffffff">Speak up.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

65
00:07:42,440 --> 00:07:44,320
<font color="#ffffff">I told you,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

66
00:07:44,400 --> 00:07:46,840
<font color="#ffffff">I don't know where Luang Pho Suea is.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

67
00:07:46,920 --> 00:07:49,520
<font color="#ffffff">And I didn't take him anywhere, okay?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

68
00:07:50,680 --> 00:07:52,760
<font color="#ffffff">A witness saw you</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

69
00:07:52,840 --> 00:07:54,280
<font color="#ffffff">take Luang Pho Suea.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

70
00:07:54,360 --> 00:07:56,480
<font color="#ffffff">Just word of mouth?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

71
00:07:57,680 --> 00:07:59,880
<font color="#ffffff">Anyone could make that up.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

72
00:07:59,960 --> 00:08:01,880
<font color="#ffffff">Where's your proof?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

73
00:08:06,920 --> 00:08:07,920
<font color="#ffffff">None.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

74
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:09,120
<font color="#ffffff">See?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

75
00:08:09,800 --> 00:08:11,640
<font color="#ffffff">I could sue you</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

76
00:08:11,720 --> 00:08:13,680
<font color="#ffffff">for doing this.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

77
00:08:22,480 --> 00:08:24,720
<font color="#ffffff">He's acting very smug, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

78
00:08:24,800 --> 00:08:27,160
<font color="#ffffff">-You want me to deal with him?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-No need.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

79
00:08:27,960 --> 00:08:29,600
<font color="#ffffff">Let Chansuek handle it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

80
00:08:30,360 --> 00:08:32,559
<font color="#ffffff">He's just as pissed as we are.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

81
00:08:55,400 --> 00:08:59,200
<font color="#ffffff">CHATCHAWAN</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">PRIVATE DETECTIVE AGENCY<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

82
00:09:05,040 --> 00:09:07,760
<font color="#ffffff">Please have some water.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

83
00:09:07,840 --> 00:09:09,240
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you very much.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

84
00:09:09,320 --> 00:09:10,520
<font color="#ffffff">My pleasure.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

85
00:09:18,040 --> 00:09:19,480
<font color="#ffffff">So you're saying</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

86
00:09:20,080 --> 00:09:21,480
<font color="#ffffff">Boonrod…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

87
00:09:21,560 --> 00:09:24,800
<font color="#ffffff">I mean, Captain Chansuek…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

88
00:09:24,880 --> 00:09:26,680
<font color="#ffffff">is on Deputy Papon's side now?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

89
00:09:31,080 --> 00:09:33,040
<font color="#ffffff">Yes. Pretty much.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

90
00:09:35,120 --> 00:09:36,600
<font color="#ffffff">No wonder.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

91
00:09:36,680 --> 00:09:39,800
<font color="#ffffff">I heard he got reinstated.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

92
00:09:40,440 --> 00:09:42,880
<font color="#ffffff">When I looked for him</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">and Luang Pho at the temple,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

93
00:09:42,960 --> 00:09:45,600
<font color="#ffffff">they'd already left.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

94
00:09:47,080 --> 00:09:48,640
<font color="#ffffff">So that's what happened.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

95
00:09:53,400 --> 00:09:56,440
<font color="#ffffff">Now Captain Chansuek</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">and Deputy Papon probably know<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

96
00:09:56,520 --> 00:09:58,440
<font color="#ffffff">that Kan helped us.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

97
00:09:58,520 --> 00:10:02,440
<font color="#ffffff">That's why Kan had me take Luang Pho away</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to ask for your help.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

98
00:10:08,000 --> 00:10:10,320
<font color="#ffffff">Sure. Don't worry at all.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

99
00:10:10,400 --> 00:10:12,360
<font color="#ffffff">We'll help you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

100
00:10:16,520 --> 00:10:18,120
<font color="#ffffff">Don't worry, Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

101
00:10:18,200 --> 00:10:22,040
<font color="#ffffff">As long as you're with us,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">we'll protect you.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

102
00:10:24,840 --> 00:10:26,960
<font color="#ffffff">Oh dear. Look.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

103
00:10:27,760 --> 00:10:31,480
<font color="#ffffff">If all this is causing you</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">so much trouble,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

104
00:10:32,040 --> 00:10:35,160
<font color="#ffffff">I should just go back to the temple.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

105
00:10:35,920 --> 00:10:37,720
<font color="#ffffff">Yeah, yeah.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

106
00:10:37,800 --> 00:10:40,240
<font color="#ffffff">But wouldn't that be too dangerous?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

107
00:10:44,400 --> 00:10:47,720
<font color="#ffffff">Like the old saying goes,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

108
00:10:48,400 --> 00:10:50,520
<font color="#ffffff">the most dangerous place</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

109
00:10:50,600 --> 00:10:53,840
<font color="#ffffff">is actually the safest.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

110
00:10:53,920 --> 00:10:54,960
<font color="#ffffff">But…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

111
00:10:55,040 --> 00:10:55,880
<font color="#ffffff">But I…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

112
00:10:56,680 --> 00:10:59,960
<font color="#ffffff">I think Luang Pho has a point.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

113
00:11:00,640 --> 00:11:04,440
<font color="#ffffff">They will not expect him</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to come right back.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

114
00:11:10,040 --> 00:11:13,800
<font color="#ffffff">All right, let's do that then.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">This way, Luang Pho can rest easy.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

115
00:11:13,880 --> 00:11:16,720
<font color="#ffffff">Yay! We get to go back to the temple!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

116
00:11:16,800 --> 00:11:18,000
<font color="#ffffff">Hey.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

117
00:11:35,040 --> 00:11:36,880
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, Captain!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

118
00:12:03,560 --> 00:12:05,640
<font color="#ffffff">Captain Kan knows we can't do anything.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

119
00:12:05,720 --> 00:12:07,320
<font color="#ffffff">Sir,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

120
00:12:07,400 --> 00:12:09,480
<font color="#ffffff">he knows way too much about this case.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

121
00:12:10,840 --> 00:12:12,200
<font color="#ffffff">Lieutenant,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

122
00:12:12,280 --> 00:12:15,720
<font color="#ffffff">issue an order</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">taking Captain Kan off this case<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

123
00:12:15,800 --> 00:12:17,560
<font color="#ffffff">and suspend him indefinitely.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

124
00:12:18,480 --> 00:12:19,640
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

125
00:12:22,040 --> 00:12:23,000
<font color="#ffffff">Sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

126
00:12:26,040 --> 00:12:29,440
<font color="#ffffff">I would like to replace Captain Kan</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">in Ms. Yok's diamond case.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

127
00:12:33,760 --> 00:12:35,240
<font color="#ffffff">I want to prove to you that</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

128
00:12:35,920 --> 00:12:37,960
<font color="#ffffff">I had nothing to do with that diamond.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

129
00:12:39,480 --> 00:12:40,920
<font color="#ffffff">Let me think about it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

130
00:12:43,520 --> 00:12:45,440
<font color="#ffffff">If you track down Luang Pho Suea</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

131
00:12:45,520 --> 00:12:48,360
<font color="#ffffff">and bring me the map to the diamond,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

132
00:12:48,440 --> 00:12:50,400
<font color="#ffffff">I'll reconsider.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

133
00:12:52,800 --> 00:12:53,880
<font color="#ffffff">Understood, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

134
00:13:22,320 --> 00:13:23,240
<font color="#ffffff">Hello?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

135
00:13:24,200 --> 00:13:25,240
<font color="#ffffff">Okay.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

136
00:13:25,320 --> 00:13:29,320
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho Suea is safe and sound.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Thanks for letting me know.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

137
00:13:35,480 --> 00:13:37,600
<font color="#ffffff">Is that so? Okay.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

138
00:13:38,200 --> 00:13:40,320
<font color="#ffffff">It is what it is, then. Okay.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

139
00:13:42,480 --> 00:13:43,760
<font color="#ffffff">Who was that on the phone?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

140
00:13:46,600 --> 00:13:49,000
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, Ya. Where's Luang Pho Suea?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

141
00:13:49,600 --> 00:13:52,440
<font color="#ffffff">Up in his quarters</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">with Mr. Chat and Noona.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

142
00:13:54,600 --> 00:13:56,360
<font color="#ffffff">We just finished moving his things up.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

143
00:13:59,360 --> 00:14:01,280
<font color="#ffffff">But you haven't answered me yet.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

144
00:14:01,360 --> 00:14:04,080
<font color="#ffffff">Who were you talking to just now?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

145
00:14:31,280 --> 00:14:33,560
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho Suea went back to his temple?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

146
00:14:33,640 --> 00:14:35,160
<font color="#ffffff">He just got here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

147
00:14:35,920 --> 00:14:38,600
<font color="#ffffff">You told me to inform you right away</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

148
00:14:38,680 --> 00:14:40,200
<font color="#ffffff">if I saw him, right?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

149
00:14:41,400 --> 00:14:43,960
<font color="#ffffff">Yeah, good job.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

150
00:14:44,040 --> 00:14:45,920
<font color="#ffffff">Who else is there with him right now?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

151
00:14:46,520 --> 00:14:50,560
<font color="#ffffff">Two women and two men.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">One looks like an officer.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

152
00:14:50,640 --> 00:14:51,760
<font color="#ffffff">Okay.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

153
00:14:52,560 --> 00:14:54,680
<font color="#ffffff">Keep a close eye on them quietly.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

154
00:14:55,520 --> 00:14:57,720
<font color="#ffffff">I'll keep you posted.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

155
00:14:57,800 --> 00:14:59,160
<font color="#ffffff">Got it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

156
00:15:17,080 --> 00:15:18,080
<font color="#ffffff">What did you say?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

157
00:15:18,800 --> 00:15:21,080
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho Suea returned to his old temple?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

158
00:15:22,640 --> 00:15:25,720
<font color="#ffffff">They've got nerve sending him</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">right back there.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

159
00:15:26,760 --> 00:15:28,240
<font color="#ffffff">The most dangerous place</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

160
00:15:29,280 --> 00:15:30,720
<font color="#ffffff">is the safest place.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

161
00:15:31,600 --> 00:15:32,960
<font color="#ffffff">But they thought wrong.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

162
00:15:33,920 --> 00:15:34,760
<font color="#ffffff">Yes.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

163
00:15:35,920 --> 00:15:38,960
<font color="#ffffff">Captain, you're very thorough.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

164
00:15:39,040 --> 00:15:40,320
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

165
00:15:41,360 --> 00:15:43,080
<font color="#ffffff">So what will you do?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

166
00:15:46,040 --> 00:15:47,840
<font color="#ffffff">I would like to take a unit</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

167
00:15:48,480 --> 00:15:50,760
<font color="#ffffff">and arrest Luang Pho Suea tonight.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

168
00:15:53,400 --> 00:15:54,440
<font color="#ffffff">Good.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

169
00:15:55,080 --> 00:15:56,280
<font color="#ffffff">Arrest him</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

170
00:15:56,360 --> 00:15:58,840
<font color="#ffffff">and bring me the map to the diamond.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

171
00:16:03,560 --> 00:16:05,000
<font color="#ffffff">Understood, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

172
00:16:30,880 --> 00:16:33,560
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you all so much</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

173
00:16:33,640 --> 00:16:36,120
<font color="#ffffff">for everything you've done for me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

174
00:16:39,360 --> 00:16:43,120
<font color="#ffffff">If there's nothing else,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

175
00:16:43,200 --> 00:16:44,960
<font color="#ffffff">please go back and get some rest.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

176
00:16:52,320 --> 00:16:55,400
<font color="#ffffff">May the Buddha bless you all.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

177
00:17:10,040 --> 00:17:14,400
<font color="#ffffff">THE TEMPLE BOY IS A SPY. PAPON KNOWS</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">LUANG PHO IS BACK. RUN. FROM B.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

178
00:17:19,720 --> 00:17:21,160
<font color="#ffffff">What's wrong, Kan?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

179
00:17:48,600 --> 00:17:49,880
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, you're here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

180
00:17:49,960 --> 00:17:51,200
<font color="#ffffff">What's the status?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

181
00:17:51,280 --> 00:17:53,360
<font color="#ffffff">Have they left yet?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

182
00:17:53,440 --> 00:17:55,360
<font color="#ffffff">Not yet.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

183
00:18:01,160 --> 00:18:02,520
<font color="#ffffff">That's strange.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

184
00:18:03,400 --> 00:18:05,120
<font color="#ffffff">They should have come out by now.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

185
00:18:06,320 --> 00:18:07,160
<font color="#ffffff">Should we go in?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

186
00:18:07,240 --> 00:18:08,360
<font color="#ffffff">Wait.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

187
00:18:09,160 --> 00:18:10,160
<font color="#ffffff">Hold on.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

188
00:18:11,320 --> 00:18:12,560
<font color="#ffffff">Wait for reinforcements.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

189
00:18:14,480 --> 00:18:16,640
<font color="#ffffff">Are you sure you kept an eye on them?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

190
00:18:16,720 --> 00:18:20,240
<font color="#ffffff">Positive! I didn't even leave</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">for a bathroom break.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

191
00:18:25,440 --> 00:18:27,360
<font color="#ffffff">It's way too quiet, Captain.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

192
00:18:28,040 --> 00:18:29,800
<font color="#ffffff">We should just storm the place.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

193
00:18:33,080 --> 00:18:34,200
<font color="#ffffff">Move in.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

194
00:18:46,160 --> 00:18:47,640
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

195
00:18:51,280 --> 00:18:54,400
<font color="#ffffff">-He ran off, Captain!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Over here, Lieutenant!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

196
00:19:03,000 --> 00:19:04,480
<font color="#ffffff">There they are!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

197
00:19:05,080 --> 00:19:06,120
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, wait!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

198
00:19:06,720 --> 00:19:08,720
<font color="#ffffff">Wait, I'll handle this.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

199
00:19:24,920 --> 00:19:26,280
<font color="#ffffff">Freeze!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

200
00:19:27,480 --> 00:19:29,080
<font color="#ffffff">Freeze!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

201
00:19:40,520 --> 00:19:41,640
<font color="#ffffff">Captain!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

202
00:19:44,400 --> 00:19:46,280
<font color="#ffffff">Hand Luang Pho Suea over right now!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

203
00:19:47,040 --> 00:19:49,200
<font color="#ffffff">So you can frame him again?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

204
00:19:49,280 --> 00:19:50,760
<font color="#ffffff">Not a chance!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

205
00:19:51,600 --> 00:19:53,000
<font color="#ffffff">Captain!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

206
00:19:53,080 --> 00:19:55,280
<font color="#ffffff">You're an officer of the law.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

207
00:19:55,360 --> 00:19:57,040
<font color="#ffffff">How can you break it?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

208
00:19:58,040 --> 00:20:00,160
<font color="#ffffff">You ungrateful bastard!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

209
00:20:02,520 --> 00:20:06,440
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho saved your life.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">How could you do this to him?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

210
00:20:10,640 --> 00:20:11,720
<font color="#ffffff">What should we do?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

211
00:20:14,800 --> 00:20:17,920
<font color="#ffffff">Captain, take Luang Pho</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">and Saranya and go.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

212
00:20:18,000 --> 00:20:19,960
<font color="#ffffff">Dad and I will cover you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

213
00:20:20,560 --> 00:20:21,560
<font color="#ffffff">Are you sure?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

214
00:20:24,040 --> 00:20:25,120
<font color="#ffffff">I'm counting on you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

215
00:20:25,200 --> 00:20:26,360
<font color="#ffffff">Piece of cake.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

216
00:20:26,440 --> 00:20:27,440
<font color="#ffffff">Let's go, Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

217
00:20:37,480 --> 00:20:38,880
<font color="#ffffff">They're getting away.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

218
00:20:56,560 --> 00:20:58,880
<font color="#ffffff">Now what, Noona? I'm out of ammo.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

219
00:20:59,920 --> 00:21:01,920
<font color="#ffffff">Same here, Dad.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

220
00:21:02,680 --> 00:21:03,680
<font color="#ffffff">What do we do?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

221
00:21:06,600 --> 00:21:10,080
<font color="#ffffff">I'll go after Luang Pho myself.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">You handle the situation here.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

222
00:21:10,160 --> 00:21:12,360
<font color="#ffffff">Watch yourselves and take them alive.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

223
00:21:12,440 --> 00:21:14,920
<font color="#ffffff">Or we'll never find Luang Pho Suea.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Got it?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

224
00:21:15,000 --> 00:21:16,320
<font color="#ffffff">Understood, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

225
00:21:21,480 --> 00:21:23,800
<font color="#ffffff">Dad, hold them off.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

226
00:21:23,880 --> 00:21:25,080
<font color="#ffffff">Got it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

227
00:22:38,240 --> 00:22:39,640
<font color="#ffffff">Where did they go?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

228
00:22:46,400 --> 00:22:48,040
<font color="#ffffff">You ungrateful bastard!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

229
00:22:53,440 --> 00:22:55,400
<font color="#ffffff">Let go of me!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

230
00:22:55,480 --> 00:22:56,720
<font color="#ffffff">Just listen to me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

231
00:22:56,800 --> 00:22:58,360
<font color="#ffffff">No, let go.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

232
00:22:58,440 --> 00:22:59,800
<font color="#ffffff">I said listen to me!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

233
00:22:59,880 --> 00:23:01,200
<font color="#ffffff">I won't!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

234
00:23:01,280 --> 00:23:02,920
<font color="#ffffff">I'm just doing my job.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

235
00:23:03,000 --> 00:23:06,680
<font color="#ffffff">Now that you're a cop, have you forgotten</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">what you owe Luang Pho?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

236
00:23:07,280 --> 00:23:11,000
<font color="#ffffff">He should have left you to die</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">in the woods.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

237
00:23:11,080 --> 00:23:12,360
<font color="#ffffff">-Let go!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Hey.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

238
00:23:12,440 --> 00:23:16,360
<font color="#ffffff">What you're doing is</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">obstructing a police officer.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

239
00:23:17,080 --> 00:23:18,360
<font color="#ffffff">A corrupt officer.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

240
00:23:18,440 --> 00:23:21,320
<font color="#ffffff">Chasing down a good monk like Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

241
00:23:22,440 --> 00:23:23,520
<font color="#ffffff">Let go.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

242
00:23:25,000 --> 00:23:27,320
<font color="#ffffff">He's a criminal in a saffron robe.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

243
00:23:30,920 --> 00:23:32,840
<font color="#ffffff">Lieutenant, hold on.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

244
00:23:32,920 --> 00:23:34,240
<font color="#ffffff">I'll handle this.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

245
00:23:36,160 --> 00:23:37,760
<font color="#ffffff">What did you just say?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

246
00:23:37,840 --> 00:23:39,880
<font color="#ffffff">Don't you dare frame Luang Pho!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

247
00:23:41,840 --> 00:23:43,640
<font color="#ffffff">I'm not framing anyone.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

248
00:23:43,720 --> 00:23:45,960
<font color="#ffffff">Do you even know</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">the monk you're protecting<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

249
00:23:50,080 --> 00:23:53,840
<font color="#ffffff">is an ex-cop who was jailed</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">for stealing evidence six years ago?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

250
00:23:59,520 --> 00:24:03,080
<font color="#ffffff">Stealing evidence six years ago?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

251
00:24:09,240 --> 00:24:10,360
<font color="#ffffff">Exactly.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

252
00:24:10,920 --> 00:24:13,040
<font color="#ffffff">Your so-called good monk</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

253
00:24:13,680 --> 00:24:15,640
<font color="#ffffff">was a dirty cop in the past.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

254
00:24:16,280 --> 00:24:18,800
<font color="#ffffff">And he was just released from prison.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

255
00:24:25,360 --> 00:24:27,840
<font color="#ffffff">That stolen evidence case six years ago?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

256
00:24:32,360 --> 00:24:33,920
<font color="#ffffff">Could it be…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

257
00:24:36,720 --> 00:24:38,200
<font color="#ffffff">Could he be…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

258
00:24:40,480 --> 00:24:41,640
<font color="#ffffff">He was Sergeant Padej.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

259
00:24:46,920 --> 00:24:49,600
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho Suea is Sergeant Padej.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

260
00:25:05,840 --> 00:25:07,360
<font color="#ffffff">Sergeant Padej…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

261
00:25:20,040 --> 00:25:21,240
<font color="#ffffff">How…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

262
00:25:23,280 --> 00:25:26,720
<font color="#ffffff">How could Luang Pho Suea</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">be Sergeant Padej?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

263
00:25:36,760 --> 00:25:38,200
<font color="#ffffff">Noona.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

264
00:25:39,360 --> 00:25:41,680
<font color="#ffffff">Do you know Sergeant Padej too?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

265
00:25:49,960 --> 00:25:52,160
<font color="#ffffff">I'm truly sorry, Lieutenant.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

266
00:25:57,040 --> 00:25:59,480
<font color="#ffffff">Honestly, it's partly my fault too.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

267
00:26:00,240 --> 00:26:03,840
<font color="#ffffff">If I had stopped Sergeant Padej</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">from being granted bail,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

268
00:26:04,600 --> 00:26:06,480
<font color="#ffffff">Dr. Prasit wouldn't have died.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

269
00:26:06,560 --> 00:26:10,080
<font color="#ffffff">Witnesses said Sergeant Padej</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

270
00:26:10,160 --> 00:26:12,560
<font color="#ffffff">pretended to visit Sergeant Sanit,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

271
00:26:12,640 --> 00:26:16,080
<font color="#ffffff">but actually sent men to silence him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

272
00:26:17,640 --> 00:26:19,600
<font color="#ffffff">How could anyone be so vile?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

273
00:26:20,640 --> 00:26:23,720
<font color="#ffffff">Where is he now? Has he been arrested?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

274
00:26:24,520 --> 00:26:26,920
<font color="#ffffff">Even though he's currently in custody,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

275
00:26:27,520 --> 00:26:29,920
<font color="#ffffff">we can't charge him with this crime.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

276
00:26:30,800 --> 00:26:32,400
<font color="#ffffff">Sergeant Padej</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

277
00:26:32,480 --> 00:26:35,760
<font color="#ffffff">used Dr. Prasit as a shield</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to take the bullets.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

278
00:26:44,080 --> 00:26:45,760
<font color="#ffffff">Are you okay?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

279
00:26:49,480 --> 00:26:50,920
<font color="#ffffff">Stay away from me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

280
00:26:53,000 --> 00:26:53,960
<font color="#ffffff">Noona.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

281
00:26:55,280 --> 00:26:56,640
<font color="#ffffff">Leave me alone!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

282
00:26:58,600 --> 00:26:59,880
<font color="#ffffff">-Hey!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Don't chase her.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

283
00:27:03,440 --> 00:27:05,160
<font color="#ffffff">There's no point chasing her.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

284
00:27:06,680 --> 00:27:09,160
<font color="#ffffff">She won't tell us where Luang Pho Suea is.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

285
00:27:09,240 --> 00:27:11,280
<font color="#ffffff">I know her well.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

286
00:27:24,960 --> 00:27:28,520
<font color="#ffffff">Is there something about</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">that woman with Chansuek, sir?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

287
00:27:30,800 --> 00:27:32,920
<font color="#ffffff">This girl looks familiar.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

288
00:27:33,000 --> 00:27:35,160
<font color="#ffffff">I think I've seen her before.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

289
00:27:35,960 --> 00:27:38,080
<font color="#ffffff">I've looked into her record.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

290
00:27:38,160 --> 00:27:40,200
<font color="#ffffff">She used to be a cop.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

291
00:27:43,720 --> 00:27:47,960
<font color="#ffffff">You might have seen her around</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">since she was in another division.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

292
00:27:48,840 --> 00:27:50,080
<font color="#ffffff">She was an officer too?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

293
00:27:50,160 --> 00:27:51,440
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

294
00:27:52,440 --> 00:27:55,760
<font color="#ffffff">Then get me her file.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

295
00:27:57,480 --> 00:27:58,800
<font color="#ffffff">Right away, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

296
00:28:19,640 --> 00:28:23,000
<font color="#ffffff">Police Lieutenant Areena Patimakorn.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

297
00:28:26,200 --> 00:28:27,920
<font color="#ffffff">Dr. Prasit.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

298
00:28:29,600 --> 00:28:30,920
<font color="#ffffff">That means…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

299
00:28:31,640 --> 00:28:33,080
<font color="#ffffff">Is something wrong, sir?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

300
00:28:36,520 --> 00:28:38,480
<font color="#ffffff">What a small world.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

301
00:28:41,840 --> 00:28:43,080
<font color="#ffffff">This girl</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

302
00:28:44,000 --> 00:28:46,000
<font color="#ffffff">did everything she could</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

303
00:28:46,080 --> 00:28:48,840
<font color="#ffffff">to put Sergeant Padej behind bars</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

304
00:28:50,200 --> 00:28:52,320
<font color="#ffffff">because she believed</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

305
00:28:52,400 --> 00:28:55,040
<font color="#ffffff">he killed her father, Dr. Prasit.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

306
00:28:57,200 --> 00:28:58,400
<font color="#ffffff">That's right.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

307
00:28:59,040 --> 00:29:02,600
<font color="#ffffff">She resigned from the force</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">out of bitterness<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

308
00:29:03,360 --> 00:29:05,480
<font color="#ffffff">after failing to bring Padej to justice.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

309
00:29:12,840 --> 00:29:14,120
<font color="#ffffff">Lieutenant.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

310
00:29:14,800 --> 00:29:15,960
<font color="#ffffff">Are you</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

311
00:29:16,720 --> 00:29:17,800
<font color="#ffffff">Dr. Prasit's daughter?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

312
00:29:20,760 --> 00:29:21,840
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

313
00:29:23,560 --> 00:29:25,520
<font color="#ffffff">I just found out you work here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

314
00:29:26,840 --> 00:29:28,520
<font color="#ffffff">Not anymore, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

315
00:29:29,200 --> 00:29:30,160
<font color="#ffffff">I've resigned.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

316
00:29:30,240 --> 00:29:32,920
<font color="#ffffff">What? Why resign?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

317
00:29:35,760 --> 00:29:37,600
<font color="#ffffff">Because being a police officer</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

318
00:29:38,600 --> 00:29:41,000
<font color="#ffffff">is pointless to me now.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

319
00:29:42,560 --> 00:29:46,960
<font color="#ffffff">If I can't even bring</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">my father's killer to justice,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

320
00:29:48,160 --> 00:29:50,400
<font color="#ffffff">what's the point of being a cop?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

321
00:29:53,720 --> 00:29:55,200
<font color="#ffffff">It's a shame</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

322
00:29:55,280 --> 00:29:57,240
<font color="#ffffff">to lose a capable officer like you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

323
00:30:00,080 --> 00:30:01,720
<font color="#ffffff">Excuse me, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

324
00:30:14,000 --> 00:30:17,200
<font color="#ffffff">I heard she tried everything to put</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Sergeant Padej behind bars,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

325
00:30:17,960 --> 00:30:19,440
<font color="#ffffff">but failed.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

326
00:30:20,040 --> 00:30:22,080
<font color="#ffffff">She must be deeply disappointed.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

327
00:30:24,840 --> 00:30:26,360
<font color="#ffffff">I'm disappointed too.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

328
00:30:27,160 --> 00:30:28,360
<font color="#ffffff">But at least</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

329
00:30:28,960 --> 00:30:33,080
<font color="#ffffff">Padej was sentenced to prison</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">for the stolen evidence case.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

330
00:30:47,640 --> 00:30:48,480
<font color="#ffffff">Yes.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

331
00:30:49,560 --> 00:30:52,320
<font color="#ffffff">I still remember the rage</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">in that girl's eyes.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

332
00:30:57,480 --> 00:30:58,960
<font color="#ffffff">But it is strange…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

333
00:31:00,240 --> 00:31:02,760
<font color="#ffffff">Why is she with Luang Pho Suea</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

334
00:31:02,840 --> 00:31:04,040
<font color="#ffffff">when…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

335
00:31:04,120 --> 00:31:05,160
<font color="#ffffff">Two possibilities.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

336
00:31:06,960 --> 00:31:11,520
<font color="#ffffff">Either she's staying close to</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho Suea, formerly Sergeant Padej,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

337
00:31:11,600 --> 00:31:13,520
<font color="#ffffff">to get revenge,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

338
00:31:13,600 --> 00:31:17,280
<font color="#ffffff">or she simply didn't recognize him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

339
00:31:20,240 --> 00:31:21,920
<font color="#ffffff">That makes sense.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

340
00:31:22,000 --> 00:31:26,400
<font color="#ffffff">Sergeant Padej and Luang Pho Suea</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">look completely different now.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

341
00:31:27,000 --> 00:31:27,840
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

342
00:31:27,920 --> 00:31:32,440
<font color="#ffffff">Unless she saw his old face,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

343
00:31:32,520 --> 00:31:34,360
<font color="#ffffff">she would not realize it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

344
00:31:36,920 --> 00:31:38,920
<font color="#ffffff">Then if an opportunity arises,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

345
00:31:39,440 --> 00:31:41,440
<font color="#ffffff">make sure to jog her memory</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

346
00:31:41,520 --> 00:31:44,680
<font color="#ffffff">that Sergeant Padej and Luang Pho Suea</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">are the exact same person.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

347
00:31:45,760 --> 00:31:47,240
<font color="#ffffff">Will do, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

348
00:31:51,240 --> 00:31:53,440
<font color="#ffffff">It might work to our advantage.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

349
00:32:14,440 --> 00:32:15,440
<font color="#ffffff">How did it go?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

350
00:32:16,040 --> 00:32:17,200
<font color="#ffffff">They got away, Captain.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

351
00:32:22,480 --> 00:32:25,160
<font color="#ffffff">Let's report to Deputy Papon</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">and plan our next move.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

352
00:33:02,600 --> 00:33:04,720
<font color="#ffffff">Are you all right, Luang Pho?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

353
00:33:05,240 --> 00:33:06,840
<font color="#ffffff">I'm fine.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

354
00:33:06,920 --> 00:33:09,360
<font color="#ffffff">What about you all? Is everyone okay?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

355
00:33:09,960 --> 00:33:10,880
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, we're fine.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

356
00:33:11,800 --> 00:33:13,440
<font color="#ffffff">But I'm not.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

357
00:33:13,520 --> 00:33:16,760
<font color="#ffffff">I'm sick of wandering around.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

358
00:33:17,480 --> 00:33:19,120
<font color="#ffffff">Watch it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

359
00:33:22,600 --> 00:33:24,680
<font color="#ffffff">I think they stopped following us.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

360
00:33:26,800 --> 00:33:28,480
<font color="#ffffff">Where are</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

361
00:33:29,440 --> 00:33:32,040
<font color="#ffffff">Chat and Noona?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

362
00:33:38,080 --> 00:33:39,120
<font color="#ffffff">It's me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

363
00:33:46,920 --> 00:33:48,160
<font color="#ffffff">Where's Noona?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

364
00:33:48,760 --> 00:33:50,880
<font color="#ffffff">Wait, isn't she with you?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

365
00:33:51,480 --> 00:33:52,400
<font color="#ffffff">No, she isn't.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

366
00:33:53,440 --> 00:33:54,840
<font color="#ffffff">Wait, what?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

367
00:33:56,000 --> 00:33:57,760
<font color="#ffffff">Where could Noona be?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

368
00:35:53,040 --> 00:35:54,760
<font color="#ffffff">She isn't picking up.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

369
00:35:56,360 --> 00:35:57,760
<font color="#ffffff">Will she be okay?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

370
00:36:02,280 --> 00:36:04,040
<font color="#ffffff">Don't worry.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

371
00:36:04,120 --> 00:36:07,440
<font color="#ffffff">I don't think Captain Chansuek</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">would hurt her.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

372
00:36:07,520 --> 00:36:10,600
<font color="#ffffff">Yeah, because those two are in love.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

373
00:36:12,600 --> 00:36:14,520
<font color="#ffffff">What should we do next?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

374
00:36:17,280 --> 00:36:21,040
<font color="#ffffff">We agreed that if anything happened,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">we'd meet here.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

375
00:36:21,120 --> 00:36:23,160
<font color="#ffffff">We should wait a little longer.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

376
00:37:25,680 --> 00:37:29,640
<font color="#ffffff">Police Lieutenant Areena Patimakorn</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">reporting for duty!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

377
00:37:34,920 --> 00:37:36,560
<font color="#ffffff">Back already, officer?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

378
00:37:37,560 --> 00:37:39,760
<font color="#ffffff">I'm home, doctor.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

379
00:37:40,920 --> 00:37:41,960
<font color="#ffffff">Have you eaten yet?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

380
00:37:43,640 --> 00:37:45,400
<font color="#ffffff">I cooked your favorite dish.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

381
00:37:45,480 --> 00:37:46,960
<font color="#ffffff">Really?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

382
00:37:47,040 --> 00:37:49,440
<font color="#ffffff">I'd better dig in then. Let's go.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

383
00:37:49,520 --> 00:37:50,920
<font color="#ffffff">-Come on, sweetie.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Okay.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

384
00:37:51,000 --> 00:37:51,880
<font color="#ffffff">Let me help you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

385
00:37:51,960 --> 00:37:53,360
<font color="#ffffff">I'll help you too.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

386
00:38:04,120 --> 00:38:06,680
<font color="#ffffff">Here comes my daughter's favorite dish.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

387
00:38:08,800 --> 00:38:10,480
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you so much, Dad.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

388
00:38:10,560 --> 00:38:12,720
<font color="#ffffff">You're the best. You know me so well.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

389
00:38:12,800 --> 00:38:15,680
<font color="#ffffff">I was just craving this.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

390
00:38:15,760 --> 00:38:18,880
<font color="#ffffff">Eat up! You've lost some weight lately.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

391
00:38:18,960 --> 00:38:21,760
<font color="#ffffff">I barely have time to eat these days.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

392
00:38:38,640 --> 00:38:41,840
<font color="#ffffff">Whoa, slow down, or you'll choke.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

393
00:38:51,080 --> 00:38:52,680
<font color="#ffffff">Here, drink some water.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

394
00:39:13,720 --> 00:39:14,880
<font color="#ffffff">This is so delicious.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

395
00:39:15,480 --> 00:39:16,800
<font color="#ffffff">Then eat up.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

396
00:41:19,120 --> 00:41:21,120
<font color="#ffffff">This can't be real, Dad.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

397
00:41:23,200 --> 00:41:26,360
<font color="#ffffff">You can't leave me like this.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

398
00:41:29,240 --> 00:41:32,640
<font color="#ffffff">Dad, wake up.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

399
00:41:45,680 --> 00:41:47,240
<font color="#ffffff">Tell me it's not true.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

400
00:41:53,600 --> 00:41:55,720
<font color="#ffffff">Don't leave me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

401
00:42:22,760 --> 00:42:24,600
<font color="#ffffff">I'm truly sorry, Lieutenant.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

402
00:42:26,000 --> 00:42:28,240
<font color="#ffffff">Dr. Prasit was a good man.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

403
00:42:28,320 --> 00:42:30,560
<font color="#ffffff">He shouldn't have ended up like this.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

404
00:42:34,600 --> 00:42:37,040
<font color="#ffffff">What actually happened to my father, sir?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

405
00:42:39,280 --> 00:42:42,600
<font color="#ffffff">Honestly, it's partly my fault too.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

406
00:42:43,640 --> 00:42:46,920
<font color="#ffffff">If I had stopped Sergeant Padej</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">from being granted bail,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

407
00:42:48,080 --> 00:42:49,880
<font color="#ffffff">Dr. Prasit wouldn't have died.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

408
00:42:50,760 --> 00:42:51,720
<font color="#ffffff">Sergeant Padej?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

409
00:42:52,560 --> 00:42:55,200
<font color="#ffffff">The suspect in the stolen evidence case?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

410
00:42:55,280 --> 00:42:57,280
<font color="#ffffff">What's he got to do with this?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

411
00:43:00,680 --> 00:43:01,720
<font color="#ffffff">Well,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

412
00:43:01,800 --> 00:43:05,760
<font color="#ffffff">Dr. Prasit was treating Sergeant Sanit,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">the key witness in the case.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

413
00:43:05,840 --> 00:43:09,040
<font color="#ffffff">Witnesses said Sergeant Padej</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

414
00:43:09,120 --> 00:43:11,000
<font color="#ffffff">pretended to visit Sergeant Sanit,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

415
00:43:11,080 --> 00:43:14,640
<font color="#ffffff">but actually sent men to silence him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

416
00:43:16,160 --> 00:43:17,560
<font color="#ffffff">What?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

417
00:43:20,800 --> 00:43:23,800
<font color="#ffffff">Luckily, Sergeant Sanit woke up in time</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

418
00:43:24,560 --> 00:43:26,960
<font color="#ffffff">and fought for his life.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

419
00:43:27,600 --> 00:43:30,920
<font color="#ffffff">In the chaos, Sergeant Padej</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

420
00:43:31,000 --> 00:43:34,680
<font color="#ffffff">used Dr. Prasit</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">as a shield to take the bullets,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

421
00:43:35,720 --> 00:43:38,480
<font color="#ffffff">killing him instantly.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

422
00:43:40,680 --> 00:43:42,760
<font color="#ffffff">How could anyone be so vile?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

423
00:43:43,920 --> 00:43:46,960
<font color="#ffffff">Where is Sergeant Padej now?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Has he been arrested?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

424
00:43:47,600 --> 00:43:50,320
<font color="#ffffff">Even though he is currently in custody,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

425
00:43:50,400 --> 00:43:53,360
<font color="#ffffff">we can't charge him with this crime.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

426
00:43:56,360 --> 00:43:57,840
<font color="#ffffff">Claims that Sergeant Padej</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

427
00:43:57,920 --> 00:44:01,080
<font color="#ffffff">used Dr. Prasit as a shield</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

428
00:44:01,920 --> 00:44:05,640
<font color="#ffffff">are only based on brief eyewitness</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">accounts from the chaos.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

429
00:44:06,560 --> 00:44:08,760
<font color="#ffffff">And the shooter escaped.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

430
00:44:12,040 --> 00:44:14,760
<font color="#ffffff">What about Sergeant Sanit?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">He must have seen it.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

431
00:44:16,360 --> 00:44:19,000
<font color="#ffffff">He disappeared as well.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

432
00:44:19,080 --> 00:44:21,160
<font color="#ffffff">We're trying our best to locate him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

433
00:44:24,120 --> 00:44:25,320
<font color="#ffffff">No.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

434
00:44:26,120 --> 00:44:28,120
<font color="#ffffff">My father cannot die in vain.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

435
00:44:28,800 --> 00:44:30,160
<font color="#ffffff">I won't accept it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

436
00:44:30,240 --> 00:44:32,760
<font color="#ffffff">Don't worry, Lieutenant.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

437
00:44:33,360 --> 00:44:35,800
<font color="#ffffff">I'll make sure Sergeant Padej</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">ends up behind bars.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

438
00:44:36,560 --> 00:44:38,600
<font color="#ffffff">Even if it's not for your father's case,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

439
00:44:39,200 --> 00:44:41,200
<font color="#ffffff">he will pay.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

440
00:45:05,760 --> 00:45:06,760
<font color="#ffffff">Lieutenant.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

441
00:45:07,640 --> 00:45:08,760
<font color="#ffffff">Are you</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

442
00:45:09,600 --> 00:45:10,680
<font color="#ffffff">Dr. Prasit's daughter?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

443
00:45:13,680 --> 00:45:15,160
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

444
00:45:16,240 --> 00:45:18,400
<font color="#ffffff">I just found out you work here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

445
00:45:19,720 --> 00:45:21,760
<font color="#ffffff">Not anymore, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

446
00:45:21,840 --> 00:45:23,040
<font color="#ffffff">I've resigned.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

447
00:45:23,120 --> 00:45:25,640
<font color="#ffffff">What? Why resign?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

448
00:45:28,480 --> 00:45:30,480
<font color="#ffffff">Because being a police officer</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

449
00:45:31,480 --> 00:45:33,520
<font color="#ffffff">is pointless to me now.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

450
00:45:35,440 --> 00:45:39,720
<font color="#ffffff">If I can't even bring</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">my father's killer to justice,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

451
00:45:41,000 --> 00:45:43,160
<font color="#ffffff">what's the point of being a cop?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

452
00:45:46,520 --> 00:45:48,080
<font color="#ffffff">It's a shame to lose</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

453
00:45:48,160 --> 00:45:50,000
<font color="#ffffff">a capable officer like you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

454
00:45:53,000 --> 00:45:54,640
<font color="#ffffff">Excuse me, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

455
00:45:59,400 --> 00:46:01,520
<font color="#ffffff">How are you doing, Dad?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

456
00:46:10,360 --> 00:46:13,520
<font color="#ffffff">How's heaven treating you?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

457
00:46:20,920 --> 00:46:23,640
<font color="#ffffff">I miss you so much.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

458
00:46:30,560 --> 00:46:32,240
<font color="#ffffff">I'm sorry</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

459
00:46:33,440 --> 00:46:36,080
<font color="#ffffff">I couldn't bring your killer</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

460
00:46:36,160 --> 00:46:38,240
<font color="#ffffff">to justice.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

461
00:46:41,480 --> 00:46:42,680
<font color="#ffffff">Yes.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

462
00:46:42,760 --> 00:46:45,040
<font color="#ffffff">Your so-called good monk</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

463
00:46:45,680 --> 00:46:47,640
<font color="#ffffff">was just a dirty cop in the past.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

464
00:46:48,320 --> 00:46:50,160
<font color="#ffffff">And he was just released from prison.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

465
00:46:50,240 --> 00:46:53,160
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho Suea is Sergeant Padej.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

466
00:47:02,880 --> 00:47:04,440
<font color="#ffffff">But now,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

467
00:47:07,800 --> 00:47:09,720
<font color="#ffffff">he's out of prison.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

468
00:47:14,520 --> 00:47:16,360
<font color="#ffffff">It's time, Dad.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

469
00:47:17,640 --> 00:47:19,840
<font color="#ffffff">Time for him to pay for his crime.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

470
00:47:25,120 --> 00:47:26,720
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho Suea escaped again?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

471
00:47:26,800 --> 00:47:28,800
<font color="#ffffff">Besides Captain Kan,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

472
00:47:28,880 --> 00:47:31,400
<font color="#ffffff">others are helping him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

473
00:47:32,000 --> 00:47:33,280
<font color="#ffffff">Who are they?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

474
00:47:33,360 --> 00:47:35,480
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho Suea is keeping the diamond?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

475
00:47:35,560 --> 00:47:36,720
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, yes.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

476
00:47:38,040 --> 00:47:41,120
<font color="#ffffff">Kamnan Sawaeng and his crew</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">have already left Mae Hong Son.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

477
00:47:41,720 --> 00:47:45,360
<font color="#ffffff">Did they already know</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho hid the diamond in the forest?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

478
00:47:46,000 --> 00:47:48,240
<font color="#ffffff">I'm glad you're safe.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

479
00:47:49,160 --> 00:47:50,640
<font color="#ffffff">If anything happened to you,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

480
00:47:51,800 --> 00:47:53,360
<font color="#ffffff">I'd be devastated.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

481
00:47:53,880 --> 00:47:55,840
<font color="#ffffff">What can I do for you?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

482
00:47:56,440 --> 00:47:58,200
<font color="#ffffff">Help me check an old case.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

483
00:47:58,280 --> 00:48:02,920
<font color="#ffffff">NEXT EPISODE</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

484
00:51:10,800 --> 00:51:15,800
<font color="#ffffff">Subtitle translation by: Jarut K.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>
